# BQ score error under MRL truncation, MS MARCO / Qwen3-Embedding-8B.
# 1M documents, 1000 queries.  At each d the 4096-d vectors are truncated to
# their first d coordinates and renormalised (the model card's MRL recipe),
# and the ground truth is that d's OWN exact FP32 top-10, so truncation loss
# is not mixed into the quantization loss.
#   c_Q      = nu/kappa, the relative score error of the ADC-BQ score
#   c_Q_iso  = sqrt(1-f^2)/f with f = ||x||_1/(sqrt(d)||x||_2), the error a
#              sign code would make on an isotropic vector of the same width
# d  c_Q  c_Q_iso  kappa  f  p95Rstar
32 0.7967 0.7460 0.7823 0.8015 21888.2
64 0.7762 0.7690 0.7900 0.7927 11220.1
128 0.7368 0.7784 0.8051 0.7891 2533.9
256 0.6695 0.7873 0.8309 0.7857 374.3
512 0.5865 0.7899 0.8625 0.7847 124.1
1024 0.4817 0.7929 0.9007 0.7836 47.0
2048 0.3853 0.8013 0.9330 0.7804 29.0
4096 0.2998 0.8166 0.9577 0.7746 22.0
